00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:40.000
that's happening at the same time in China. Yeah. Because there's no connection. It's an anthropological question asked to, people who are historical scholars. And they found that completely thrilling because it's allowed them all really to look at familiar objects and ask a totally new kind of question

