00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:08.000
and suggest the commonalities of human behavior wherever we are. We all behave roughly, equally badly, equally well. And surprisingly, more or less in the same way. Yeah. Were there heated arguments? Was there, you know, table pounding when people were deciding which artifacts to... Curators don't normally pound the table.

