00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:43.000
There was a certain amount of shrill advocacy. Okay. For my particular piece and a certain amount of sulking that others didn't make it. But it was normally extremely good timid. And because it was a new kind of conversation for all of them, very, very excited. And because what we were looking at was not the history of the world, but our history, a very peculiar one. And one of the histories we wanted to tell almost unspoken through it, because every object came from the museum,

